{"ref":"BDB, בֵּית אָ֫וֶן","hw":"בֵּית אָ֫וֶן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית אָ֫וֶן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc. (</strong><em>house of iniquity</em> or <em>idolatry</em>? hardly likely unless as alteration of orig. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית אוֹן</span>, <em>house of wealth</em> or <em>strength</em><strong>)</strong> eastward from Bethel <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:2\" href=\"/Joshua.7.2\">Jos 7:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:12\" href=\"/Joshua.18.12\">18:12</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.23\">1 S 14:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.5\">1 S 13:5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית־א׳</span> (on <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:15\" href=\"/Hosea.4.15\">Ho 4:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:8\" href=\"/Hosea.5.8\">5:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:5\" href=\"/Hosea.10.5\">10:5</a> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, בֵּֽיתְאֵל\" href=\"/BDB,_בֵּֽיתְאֵל\", dir=\"rtl\">בֵּֽיתְאֵל</a> infr.); site unknown.","next":"BDB, בֵּֽיתְאֵל","prev":"BDB, בַּ֫יִת²"}